   <narrative xml:lang="EN">land info system</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">land info system</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida har sedan 1992 finansierat den litauiska landreformprocessen. En komponent av denna r&#xf6;r utvecklingen av ett &quot;Land Information System&quot;. Detta projekt omfattar fortsatt samarbete mellan State Land Cadastre and Register och Swedesurvey AB. Insatsen kan delas in i fem kompo- nenter bl a fastighetsv&#xe4;rdering, utbildning, lagstiftningsst&#xf6;d.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has since 1992 supported the Lithuanian Land Reform process. One component of this support concerns the development of a Lithuanian Land Information System. The current project constitutes continued co-operation between the State Land Cadastre and Register and SwedesurveyAB, in the implement.of the provisions of the Lith. Nat. Acquis Progr.</narrative>
  </description>
